<div class="two-column" style="margin-top:27px"><div class="stack"><section class="card card-pad"><div class="card-header"><h2>Your rhythm, at a glance.</h2><span class="tiny-pill">Last 60 days</span></div><?php $map=array_column($activity,null,'local_date');$now=new DateTimeImmutable('now',new DateTimeZone($currentUser['timezone'])); ?><div class="streak-calendar" aria-label="Qualifying and protected streak dates"><?php for($i=59;$i>=0;$i--):$d=$now->modify('-'.$i.' days');$a=$map[$d->format('Y-m-d')]??null;$state=$a&&$a['protected']?'protected':($a&&$a['qualified_at']?'qualified':''); ?><span class="streak-day <?= $state ?>" title="<?= e($d->format('M j').': '.($state?:'No qualifying activity')) ?>"><?= $d->format('j') ?></span><?php endfor; ?></div><p class="fine-print" style="margin-top:17px">Orange = daily target reached. Blue = protection used. Dates follow <?= e($currentUser['timezone']) ?>. Merely opening a page does not maintain a streak.</p></section><section class="card table-card"><div class="card-pad" style="padding-bottom:0"><div class="card-header"><h2>Every point has a story.</h2></div></div><?php if($ledger): ?><div class="table-responsive"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>What you earned it for</th><th>XP</th><th>When</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($ledger as $t): ?><tr><td><strong><?= e($t['reason']) ?></strong></td><td class="ledger-amount"><?= $t['amount']>0?'+':'' ?><?= number($t['amount']) ?></td><td><?= niceDate($t['created_at'],'M j') ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div><?php pagination($total); ?><?php else: emptyState('bolt','Your first XP is waiting.','Complete a lesson to start your own story of progress.','/my-learning','Find my next lesson');endif; ?></section></div><aside><section class="card card-pad"><span class="icon-tile blue" style="margin-bottom:17px"><?= icon('shield',24) ?></span><h2 style="font-size:19px;margin-bottom:12px">A little room for real life.</h2><p class="fine-print"><?php if((int)setting('streak_protection_enabled',0)): ?>Earned protection can cover one missed yesterday when the day before qualified. Up to <?= (int)setting('streak_protection_monthly_limit',2) ?> protections can be used per calendar month, with at most <?= (int)setting('streak_protection_max',2) ?> held at once. It’s applied automatically and recorded.<?php else: ?>Streak protection is not currently enabled. Missing a daily goal resets your current streak, not your earned XP or personal best.<?php endif; ?></p><div class="key-value" style="margin-top:15px"><span>Protections ready</span><strong><?= count(array_filter($protections,fn($p)=>!$p['used_date'])) ?></strong></div><?php if((int)setting('streak_protection_enabled',0) && (int)setting('streak_protection_purchase',0)): ?><form action="<?= e(route_url('/api/protection/buy')) ?>" method="post" data-api data-confirm="Use your virtual coins for one streak protection? No money is charged."><?= csrfField() ?><input type="hidden" name="request_key" value="<?= bin2hex(random_bytes(16)) ?>"><button class="btn btn-secondary btn-small btn-block" style="margin-top:17px">Get protection · <?= (int)setting('streak_protection_cost',100) ?> coins</button></form><?php endif; ?><?php foreach(array_slice($protections,0,6) as $p): ?><div class="key-value"><span><?= $p['used_date']?'Used '.niceDate($p['used_date'],'M j'):'Earned '.niceDate($p['created_at'],'M j') ?></span><?= badge($p['used_date']?'protected':'available') ?></div><?php endforeach; ?><p class="fine-print" style="margin-top:15px">Streak milestones are lifetime awards in this version. Protections do not earn learning credit or lesson completion.</p></section></aside></div>
